    "category": "Binary Search",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the prices of candies and an integer k, choose exactly k candies. The tastiness of a basket is defined as the minimum absolute difference between the prices of any two chosen candies. Return the maximum possible tastiness.",
